{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>\u201cThere will never be a prison big enough to lock up the spirit of a single man.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/night.gif?t=1748440255\" /></div> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>History :</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After having an accident with your wife, you wake up in a psychiatric hospital without knowing why or how you got here. Explore your surroundings to discover the secrets that led you here. Your adventure will not be easy. A creature seems to have chased you and doesn't intend to let you achieve your goals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to Brain...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Gameplay:</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Varied levels exploring more and more the depths of horror</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 A soundtrack created especially for the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \u2022 Two possible endings </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Several secrets to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/extras/Foot.gif?t=1748440255\" /></div></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754960?t=1748440255","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3754960?t=1748440255","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/4ca43c09f0d7cf39116fa49886fb30418e1b1bb6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748440255","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3754960/4ca43c09f0d7cf39116fa49886fb30418e1b1bb6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748440255","categories":[{"descript